<title>USA: Boston Communications to file offering.</title>
<headline>Boston Communications to file offering.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Communications Group Inc said on Monday that it intended to file a 3-million- share offering with the Securities and Exchange Commission this week.</p>
<p>&quot;The net proceeds of the offering will be used by the company to expand its C2C Network for prepaid wireless services and for general corporate purposes, including working capital,&quot; said President Paul Tobin.</p>
<p>Boston Communications Group Inc develops and markets call processing services, prepaid network services and teleservices.</p>
